<title>PHILIPPINES: C&amp;P Homes 9-mth net up at 2.007 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>C&amp;P Homes 9-mth net up at 2.007 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>			(in billion pesos)</p>
<p>    Sales			6.908 vs 4.968</p>
<p>    Net income		 2.007 vs 1.421</p>
<p>Note: Full name C&amp;P Homes Inc. Company's chief executive officer Manuel Villar said the strong income performance was due to the strong demand in low-cost housing units.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
